gap-3! opacity-100!">The Shopify for Prediction Markets</div><h1 class="hero-title font-sans text-[clamp(46px,6.2vw,88px)] leading-[0.94] font-bold tracking-tighter text-white"><span class="hero-title-line">Your own Polymarket</span><span class="hero-title-line">Live in 15 minutes. <span class="hero-title-accent">Free</span></span></h1></div><div class="hero-copy-side"><p class="hero-copy-sub text-[clamp(17px,1.75vw,20px)] leading-[1.55] text-muted">Your audience already predicts things every day. Launch your own market for any niche — crypto, sports, politics, anything — and earn a fee on every trade.</p><div class="hero-copy-actions flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/launch" class="btn-cta btn-cta-primary"><span class="cta-label">Start your prediction market</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="hero-copy-proof font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.16em] text-faint uppercase">Free launch • No code • Live in minutes</div></div></div><div class="hero-market-stage" aria-hidden="true"><div class="hero-market-scene hero-market-scene-a"><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-a1" style="--hero-market-rotate:-9deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=kuest.com%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fbitcoin-150k.png&amp;w=320&amp;h=320&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="320" height="320" fetchPriority="low" alt="" class="size-full object-cover"/></div></div></figure><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-a2 is-featured" data-expand-side="right" style="--hero-market-rotate:-4deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=kuest.com%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Ffed-rate-move.png&amp;w=320&amp;h=320&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="320" height="320" fetchPriority="low" alt="" class="size-full object-cover"/></div><div class="protocol-hero-card-panel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="protocol-hero-card-title">Will the Fed cut rates before July?</div><div class="protocol-hero-card-actions"><span class="hero-market-tooltip-btn hero-market-tooltip-btn-yes">Yes</span><span class="hero-market-tooltip-btn hero-market-tooltip-btn-no">No</span></div></div></div></figure><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-a3" style="--hero-market-rotate:8deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=kuest.com%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Funiswap-v4-mainnet.png&amp;w=320&amp;h=320&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="320" height="320" fetchPriority="low" alt="" class="size-full object-cover"/></div></div></figure><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-a4" style="--hero-market-rotate:4deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=kuest.com%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fethereum-flippening.png&amp;w=320&amp;h=320&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="320" height="320" fetchPriority="low" alt="" class="size-full object-cover"/></div></div></figure></div><div class="hero-market-scene hero-market-scene-b"><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-b1" style="--hero-market-rotate:-7deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"></div></div></figure><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-b2 is-featured" data-expand-side="left" style="--hero-market-rotate:-2deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"></div><div class="protocol-hero-card-panel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="protocol-hero-card-title">Will Trump announce a U.S. Bitcoin reserve this year?</div><div class="protocol-hero-card-actions"><span class="hero-market-tooltip-btn hero-market-tooltip-btn-yes">Yes</span><span class="hero-market-tooltip-btn hero-market-tooltip-btn-no">No</span></div></div></div></figure><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-b3" style="--hero-market-rotate:7deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"></div></div></figure><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-b4" style="--hero-market-rotate:3deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"></div></div></figure></div><div class="hero-market-scene hero-market-scene-c"><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-c1" style="--hero-market-rotate:-8deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"></div></div></figure><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-c2 is-featured" data-expand-side="right" style="--hero-market-rotate:-3deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"></div><div class="protocol-hero-card-panel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="protocol-hero-card-title">Will a Russia-Ukraine ceasefire be announced before year-end?</div><div class="protocol-hero-card-actions"><span class="hero-market-tooltip-btn hero-market-tooltip-btn-yes">Yes</span><span class="hero-market-tooltip-btn hero-market-tooltip-btn-no">No</span></div></div></div></figure><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-c3" style="--hero-market-rotate:8deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"></div></div></figure><figure class="hero-market-card hero-market-card-c4" style="--hero-market-rotate:4deg"><div class="protocol-hero-card-shell"><div class="hero-market-card-media"></div></div></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap attention-scroll-panel" id="p1-scroll"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="panel-inner attention-scroll-shell"><div class="attention-scroll-copy" aria-label="Attention shifts create windows of opportunity"><div class="attention-scroll-block"><p class="attention-scroll-line" data-attention-step="line">For years, money followed attention.</p><p class="attention-scroll-line" data-attention-step="line">Affiliates. Dropshipping. Online courses. Betting.</p><p class="attention-scroll-line" data-attention-step="line">Each wave opened a window — and closed right after.</p><p class="attention-scroll-line attention-scroll-line-pivot" data-attention-step="line">Did you get in early, or arrive when it was already saturated?</p></div><div class="attention-scroll-block attention-scroll-block-map"><p class="attention-scroll-line" data-attention-step="line">Today, two platforms control a market worth billions.</p><div class="attention-scroll-brand-row" data-attention-step="brands" aria-hidden="true"><div class="attention-scroll-brand"><img src="/assets/images/polymarket-logo.svg" width="132" height="28" loading="lazy" alt="Polymarket" class="attention-scroll-brand-logo"/></div><div class="attention-scroll-brand"><img src="/assets/images/kalshi-logo.svg" width="124" height="28" loading="lazy" alt="Kalshi" class="attention-scroll-brand-logo"/></div></div><p class="attention-scroll-line" data-attention-step="line">73% of Polymarket&#x27;s estimated desktop traffic comes from outside the US.</p><p class="attention-scroll-line" data-attention-step="line">Most audiences still have no local platform to call their own.</p></div><div class="attention-scroll-block"><p class="attention-scroll-line attention-scroll-line-lead" data-attention-step="line">You can choose:</p><p class="attention-scroll-line" data-attention-step="line">be one more trader trying to call the next prediction —</p><p class="attention-scroll-line attention-scroll-line-pivot" data-attention-step="line">or build the house where everyone else plays.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap panel-static panel-compact" id="p-social"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="panel-inner max-w-295"><div class="r market-numbers market-numbers-4"><article class="mn"><div class="mn-num">100+</div><div class="mn-label">markets launched on testnet</div></article><article class="mn"><div class="mn-num">0.5–3%</div><div class="mn-label">fee per trade, direct to your wallet</div></article><article class="mn"><div class="mn-num">15 min</div><div class="mn-label">average time to go live</div></article><article class="mn"><div class="mn-num">Free</div><div class="mn-label">to launch, usage-based at scale</div></article></div><div class="r mt-6! flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 border-t border-white/6 pt-5! lg:flex-row"><div class="flex"><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F1%3Fv%3D4&amp;w=28&amp;h=28&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="28" height="28" style="margin-left:0" loading="lazy" alt="" class="size-7 rounded-full border-2 border-[#0e1117] object-cover"/><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F2%3Fv%3D4&amp;w=28&amp;h=28&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="28" height="28" style="margin-left:-8px" loading="lazy" alt="" class="size-7 rounded-full border-2 border-[#0e1117] object-cover"/><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F3%3Fv%3D4&amp;w=28&amp;h=28&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="28" height="28" style="margin-left:-8px" loading="lazy" alt="" class="size-7 rounded-full border-2 border-[#0e1117] object-cover"/><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F4%3Fv%3D4&amp;w=28&amp;h=28&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="28" height="28" style="margin-left:-8px" loading="lazy" alt="" class="size-7 rounded-full border-2 border-[#0e1117] object-cover"/><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F5%3Fv%3D4&amp;w=28&amp;h=28&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="28" height="28" style="margin-left:-8px" loading="lazy" alt="" class="size-7 rounded-full border-2 border-[#0e1117] object-cover"/></div><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[.12em] text-faint uppercase">Joined by 100+ operators in early access</span></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap panel-static" id="p2"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="panel-inner prediction-explainer"><div class="prediction-explainer-copy r"><div class="hero-kicker prediction-explainer-kicker">YOUR AUDIENCE ALREADY DOES THIS — FOR FREE</div><h2 class="prediction-explainer-title">Prediction Market</h2><p class="prediction-explainer-sub">Your followers already predict things every day. Who wins the next election. Whether Bitcoin hits $100k. Who gets eliminated this week. They argue about it in your comments, your DMs, your community — and none of that energy earns you a cent. A prediction market turns that conviction into real trades, with real money. Every trade pays a fee. That fee goes to you.</p></div><div class="prediction-explainer-stage r rd" id="predictionExplainerStage"><div class="prediction-showcase-tabs niche-tabs-wrap" id="predictionNicheTabs"><button type="button" class="niche-tab is-active" data-prediction-niche="0" style="border-color:rgba(247,147,26,0.46);background:rgba(247,147,26,0.12);color:#f7931a;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.18), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bitcoin" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.767 19.089c4.924.868 6.14-6.025 1.216-6.894m-1.216 6.894L5.86 18.047m5.908 1.042-.347 1.97m1.563-8.864c4.924.869 6.14-6.025 1.215-6.893m-1.215 6.893-3.94-.694m5.155-6.2L8.29 4.26m5.908 1.042.348-1.97M7.48 20.364l3.126-17.727"></path></svg> <!-- -->Crypto &amp; Finance</button><button type="button" class="niche-tab " data-prediction-niche="1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trophy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 14.66V17a1 1 0 0 1-1 1 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2"></path><path d="M14 14.66V17a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path><path d="M17.916 10H19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 22 7.5V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-3"></path><path d="M4 22h16"></path><path d="M6 9a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1z"></path><path d="M6.084 10H4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2 7.5V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3"></path></svg> <!-- -->Sports</button><button type="button" class="niche-tab " data-prediction-niche="2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-landmark" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 18v-7"></path><path d="M11.119 2.205a2 2 0 0 1 1.762 0l7.84 3.846A.5.5 0 0 1 20.5 7h-17a.5.5 0 0 1-.22-.949z"></path><path d="M14 18v-7"></path><path d="M18 18v-7"></path><path d="M3 22h18"></path><path d="M6 18v-7"></path></svg> <!-- -->Politics</button><button type="button" class="niche-tab " data-prediction-niche="3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clapperboard" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12.296 3.464 3.02 3.956"></path><path d="M20.2 6 3 11l-.9-2.4c-.3-1.1.3-2.2 1.3-2.5l13.5-4c1.1-.3 2.2.3 2.5 1.3z"></path><path d="M3 11h18v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><path d="m6.18 5.276 3.1 3.899"></path></svg> <!-- -->Entertainment</button><button type="button" class="niche-tab " data-prediction-niche="4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg> <!-- -->Communities</button><button type="button" class="niche-tab " data-prediction-niche="5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flame" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4"></path></svg> <!-- -->Memes &amp; Others</button></div><div class="prediction-showcase-grid" id="predictionNicheCardsGrid"><article class="prediction-showcase-card" style="--prediction-accent:#f7931a;--prediction-accent-rgb:247,147,26"><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=kuest.com%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fbitcoin-150k.png&amp;w=92&amp;h=92&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="92" height="92" loading="lazy" alt="" class="prediction-showcase-thumb"/><h3 class="prediction-showcase-title">Will Bitcoin trade above $150K before Q3?</h3><div class="prediction-showcase-list"><div class="prediction-showcase-row"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-label">Yes</span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-track"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-fill" style="width:61%"></span></span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-pct">61<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="prediction-showcase-row"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-label">No</span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-track"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-fill" style="width:39%"></span></span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-pct">39<!-- -->%</span></div></div></article><article class="prediction-showcase-card" style="--prediction-accent:#f7931a;--prediction-accent-rgb:247,147,26"><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=kuest.com%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fethereum-flippening.png&amp;w=92&amp;h=92&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="92" height="92" loading="lazy" alt="" class="prediction-showcase-thumb"/><h3 class="prediction-showcase-title">Will Ethereum flip Bitcoin&#x27;s market cap in 2025?</h3><div class="prediction-showcase-list"><div class="prediction-showcase-row"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-label">Yes</span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-track"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-fill" style="width:18%"></span></span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-pct">18<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="prediction-showcase-row"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-label">No</span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-track"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-fill" style="width:82%"></span></span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-pct">82<!-- -->%</span></div></div></article><article class="prediction-showcase-card" style="--prediction-accent:#f7931a;--prediction-accent-rgb:247,147,26"><img src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=kuest.com%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Ffed-rate-move.png&amp;w=92&amp;h=92&amp;fit=cover&amp;output=webp&amp;q=80&amp;we=1&amp;default=1" width="92" height="92" loading="lazy" alt="" class="prediction-showcase-thumb"/><h3 class="prediction-showcase-title">Next Fed rate move</h3><div class="prediction-showcase-list"><div class="prediction-showcase-row"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-label">Cut</span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-track"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-fill" style="width:42%"></span></span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-pct">42<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="prediction-showcase-row"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-label">Hold</span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-track"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-fill" style="width:51%"></span></span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-pct">51<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="prediction-showcase-row"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-label">Hike</span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-track"><span class="prediction-showcase-row-fill" style="width:7%"></span></span><span class="prediction-showcase-row-pct">7<!-- -->%</span></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap panel-static" id="p3"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="panel-inner max-w-295 grid-cols-1 gap-10"><div class="solution-split r"><div class="solution-head"><h2 class="sh">A billion-dollar market. Concentrated in two companies. Until now.</h2></div><div class="solution-body"><div class="solution-copy-lead"><div class="bt"><span class="solution-copy-line">Polymarket and Kalshi dominate — but they are closed. You trade on them. Not with them.</span><span class="solution-copy-callout"><span class="solution-copy-callout-mark"><span class="kuest-logo-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span>Kuest was built to change that.</span></span><span class="solution-copy-block"><span class="solution-copy-line">In just a few clicks, you launch your own prediction market site: with your brand, your categories, and your custom markets.</span><span class="solution-copy-line">. We handle the smart contracts, infrastructure, liquidity, and integrations. You focus on your audience — and collect fees from every trade that happens on your site.</span></span></div></div><div class="solution-proof-pane"><div class="solution-proof-rotator" id="solutionProofRotator"><article class="solution-proof-card is-active"><div class="solution-proof-card-label">Combined latest valuations</div><div class="solution-proof-card-value">$43B</div><div class="solution-proof-card-copy"><a href="https://news.kalshi.com/p/kalshi-raises-1-billion-22-billion-valuation-institutional-demand-surges" class="source-link" data-source-outlet="Kalshi News" data-source-title="Kalshi Raises $1 Billion at a $22 Billion Valuation">Kalshi</a> announced a $22B valuation; <a href="https://news.bloomberglaw.com/private-equity/polymarket-funding-round-led-by-1789-values-firm-at-21-billion" class="source-link" data-source-outlet="Bloomberg" data-source-title="Polymarket Funding Led by 1789 Values Firm at $21 Billion">Bloomberg reported Polymarket at a $21B post-money valuation</a>.</div></article><article class="solution-proof-card "><div class="solution-proof-card-label">Combined August 2026 volume</div><div class="solution-proof-card-value">$45.33B</div><div class="solution-proof-card-copy">Kalshi, Polymarket, and Polymarket US recorded $45.33B in combined trading volume in August 2026, according to <a href="https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-09-02-kalshi-polymarkets-volume-falls-august-413309" class="source-link" data-source-outlet="The Block" data-source-title="Kalshi and Polymarket&#x27;s Combined Volume in August 2026">The Block</a>.</div></article><article class="solution-proof-card "><div class="solution-proof-card-label">Combined weekly volume</div><div class="solution-proof-card-value">$12.19B</div><div class="solution-proof-card-copy">Kalshi recorded $10.17B and Polymarket $2.02B in weekly volume for the week ending August 30, 2026, or $12.19B combined excluding Polymarket US, according to <a href="https://defirate.com/prediction-markets/volume/kalshi/" class="source-link" data-source-outlet="DeFi Rate" data-source-title="Kalshi Weekly Volume — Week Ending August 30, 2026">DeFi Rate</a> and <a href="https://defirate.com/prediction-markets/volume/polymarket/" class="source-link" data-source-outlet="DeFi Rate" data-source-title="Polymarket Weekly Volume — Week Ending August 30, 2026">DeFi Rate</a>.</div></article><article class="solution-proof-card "><div class="solution-proof-card-label">Kalshi valuation</div><div class="solution-proof-card-value">$22B</div><div class="solution-proof-card-copy">Kalshi announced a $1B Series F at a $22B valuation, according to <a href="https://news.kalshi.com/p/kalshi-raises-1-billion-22-billion-valuation-institutional-demand-surges" class="source-link" data-source-outlet="Kalshi News" data-source-title="Kalshi Raises $1 Billion at a $22 Billion Valuation">Kalshi News</a>.</div></article><article class="solution-proof-card "><div class="solution-proof-card-label">Polymarket reported valuation</div><div class="solution-proof-card-value">$21B</div><div class="solution-proof-card-copy">Bloomberg reported a $1B Polymarket funding round at a $21B post-money valuation, via <a href="https://news.bloomberglaw.com/private-equity/polymarket-funding-round-led-by-1789-values-firm-at-21-billion" class="source-link" data-source-outlet="Bloomberg" data-source-title="Polymarket Funding Led by 1789 Values Firm at $21 Billion">Bloomberg</a>.</div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap panel-static" id="p3-flow"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="panel-inner max-w-295 grid-cols-1 gap-10"><div class="solution-flow-stage r"><div class="solution-flow-head"><h2 class="sh">No code. No server. No technical headaches.</h2></div><div class="solution-timeline" aria-label="How Kuest works"><div class="solution-timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="solution-timeline-head"></span></div><article class="solution-timeline-step solution-timeline-step-top solution-timeline-step-right"><div class="solution-timeline-side" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="solution-timeline-node" aria-hidden="true"><span>1</span></div><div class="solution-timeline-copy"><h3 class="solution-timeline-title">Pick your niche and write your questions</h3><p class="solution-timeline-text">Sports, crypto, politics, memes — anything your audience already argues about. You set the questions, the fee rate, and your brand.</p></div></article><article class="solution-timeline-step solution-timeline-step-bottom solution-timeline-step-left"><div class="solution-timeline-node" aria-hidden="true"><span>2</span></div><div class="solution-timeline-copy"><h3 class="solution-timeline-title">Go live — we handle the infrastructure</h3><p class="solution-timeline-text">Settlement, wallets, liquidity, blockchain — all running before you finish setup. Your market is live in under 15 minutes with no code.</p></div><div class="solution-timeline-side" aria-hidden="true"></div></article><article class="solution-timeline-step solution-timeline-step-top solution-timeline-step-right"><div class="solution-timeline-side" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="solution-timeline-node" aria-hidden="true"><span>3</span></div><div class="solution-timeline-copy"><h3 class="solution-timeline-title">Every trade pays you directly</h3><p class="solution-timeline-text">Your audience bets. The fee goes straight to your wallet. No intermediary, no revenue share, no waiting.</p></div></article><div class="solution-timeline-cta"><div class="solution-cta-block solution-cta-block-inline"><a href="/launch" class="btn-cta btn-cta-primary" id="solutionCtaBtn"><span class="cta-label">Start earning from my audience</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a><div class="solution-cta-note" id="solutionCtaNote">FREE · NO CODE · LIVE IN 15 MINUTES</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap panel-static" id="p-features"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="panel-inner max-w-295 grid-cols-1 gap-10"><div class="r text-center"><div class="slbl justify-center">Everything already built</div><h2 class="sh">The full stack. Ready to go live.</h2><p class="bt section-copy-center">From the trading engine to your leaderboard, every feature you’d expect from a trading platform is already running. You just add your brand.</p></div><div class="r mini-cards-grid mini-cards-grid-feature"><div class="mini-card mini-card-feature"><div><div class="mini-card-head"><span class="mini-card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-earth" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54"></path><path d="M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17"></path><path d="M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span><div class="mini-card-title">Your domain. Your brand. Any language.</div></div><div class="mini-card-copy">Custom domain, logo, colors, and UI language. Available in English, Portuguese, Spanish, German, French, Japanese, Chinese, Arabic, Russian, Italian, and Polish out of the box.</div></div></div><div class="mini-card mini-card-feature"><div><div class="mini-card-head"><span class="mini-card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flame" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4"></path></svg></span><div class="mini-card-title">Shared liquidity from day one.</div></div><div class="mini-card-copy">Mirror active Polymarket markets with built-in order flow. Your site feels live the moment it launches — no cold start, no empty order books.</div></div></div><div class="mini-card mini-card-feature"><div><div class="mini-card-head"><span class="mini-card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trophy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 14.66V17a1 1 0 0 1-1 1 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2"></path><path d="M14 14.66V17a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path><path d="M17.916 10H19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 22 7.5V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-3"></path><path d="M4 22h16"></path><path d="M6 9a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1z"></path><path d="M6.084 10H4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2 7.5V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3"></path></svg></span><div class="mini-card-title">Leaderboard + PnL built in.</div></div><div class="mini-card-copy">Trader rankings, profit and loss tracking, and activity feeds are live by default. Your community has a reason to keep coming back.</div></div></div><div class="mini-card mini-card-feature"><div><div class="mini-card-head"><span class="mini-card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle><line x1="8.59" x2="15.42" y1="13.51" y2="17.49"></line><line x1="15.41" x2="8.59" y1="6.51" y2="10.49"></line></svg></span><div class="mini-card-title">On-chain affiliate system.</div></div><div class="mini-card-copy">Let others promote your market and earn a share of fees — settled trustlessly on-chain. No manual payouts, no spreadsheets.</div></div></div><div class="mini-card mini-card-feature"><div><div class="mini-card-head"><span class="mini-card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg></span><div class="mini-card-title">Bot SDKs for automated trading.</div></div><div class="mini-card-copy">Python and Rust SDKs let market makers and power users run bots directly on your platform — increasing volume and depth automatically.</div></div></div><div class="mini-card mini-card-feature"><div><div class="mini-card-head"><span class="mini-card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><div class="mini-card-title">OpenZeppelin-audited contracts.</div></div><div class="mini-card-copy">Smart contracts derived from Polymarket&#x27;s architecture. UMA-based resolution for transparent, verifiable market settlement. You don&#x27;t need to know any of this — it just works.</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap panel-static" id="p3-demo"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="panel-inner preview-section site-demo-section max-w-[95vw]! grid-cols-1 gap-10"><div class="site-demo-copy"><div class="site-demo-copy-inner"><h2 class="sh">This is what your site will look like.</h2><p class="bt">This is a functional demo with mirrored Polymarket markets. Explore it, trade on it, and imagine it with your brand, your audience, and your questions.</p></div></div><div class="r rd hero-preview-wide hero-preview-break"><div class="site-preview scroll-mt-24 mx-auto!" id="sitePreview"><div class="site-preview-head"><div class="site-preview-dots" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><a href="https://demo.kuest.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-preview-url">demo.kuest.com</a><span class="site-preview-live"><span class="site-preview-live-dot"></span>Live Demo</span><button type="button" class="site-preview-mode-btn" id="sitePreviewModeBtn" aria-label="Switch to mobile preview" aria-pressed="false" title="Switch to mobile preview" aria-hidden="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-monitor-smartphone" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h8"></path><path d="M10 19v-3.96 3.15"></path><path d="M7 19h5"></path><rect width="6" height="10" x="16" y="12" rx="2"></rect></svg></button></div><div class="site-preview-body"><iframe id="sitePreviewFrame" class="site-preview-frame" title="Kuest live site preview" loading="lazy" src="https://demo.kuest.com/?embed-preview=1" sandbox="allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-forms allow-popups" referrerPolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap panel-static panel-compact" id="p-mid-cta"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="cta-content r py-10"><h2 class="cta-h">Ready to turn your audience into a revenue stream?</h2><div class="cta-btns"><a href="/launch" class="btn-cta btn-cta-primary"><span class="cta-label">Launch my market — it&#x27;s free</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap panel-static" id="p8"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="panel-inner max-w-295 grid-cols-1 items-start"><div class="r faq-layout"><div class="faq-head"><h2 class="sh">FAQ</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">How long does it take, and do I need technical skills?</summary><div class="faq-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="faq-panel"><div class="faq-panel-inner"><div class="faq-a">Most markets go live in under 15 minutes. You launch from <a href="/launch">/launch</a> with a guided setup — no code, no contract deployment, no DevOps. If you can set up a Shopify store, you can launch a Kuest market.</div></div></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Can I show Polymarket markets on my site?</summary><div class="faq-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="faq-panel"><div class="faq-panel-inner"><div class="faq-a">Yes. You can mirror active markets from Polymarket — either all categories or only the ones relevant to your niche (crypto, sports, politics, etc.). These mirrored markets come with shared liquidity from day one, so your site feels live from the moment it&#x27;s published.</div></div></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Can I create my own markets? Who provides the liquidity?</summary><div class="faq-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="faq-panel"><div class="faq-panel-inner"><div class="faq-a">Yes. You can create custom markets around any question you choose. Mirrored Polymarket markets have shared liquidity built in. Markets you create yourself depend on your audience trading — so your own content and community drive the volume there. You can also opt into cross-market liquidity sharing for creator markets.</div></div></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">How do I make money, and can I set my own fees?</summary><div class="faq-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="faq-panel"><div class="faq-panel-inner"><div class="faq-a">You set a trading fee rate on your market — typically between 0.5% and 3%. Every time someone trades, that fee goes directly to your wallet. No revenue share, no intermediary, no waiting. You control the rate and can change it at any time.</div></div></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Can I use my own domain and branding?</summary><div class="faq-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="faq-panel"><div class="faq-panel-inner"><div class="faq-a">Yes. You can launch with your own domain, logo, colors, and category structure so the market feels entirely native to your brand — not a Kuest white-label.</div></div></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">How are markets resolved?</summary><div class="faq-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="faq-panel"><div class="faq-panel-inner"><div class="faq-a">Kuest uses UMA-based resolution rails for transparent, verifiable settlement. The smart contracts are derived from Polymarket&#x27;s — audited by OpenZeppelin — and adapted to support shared liquidity across markets. You don&#x27;t need to understand any of this to use it, but it means the financial infrastructure under your market is the same stack that&#x27;s processed billions in volume.</div></div></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Is there a cost to launch?</summary><div class="faq-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="faq-panel"><div class="faq-panel-inner"><div class="faq-a">The creator launch flow is free to start. Production infrastructure pricing is usage-based — you pay when you scale, not before. Enterprise plans start at $100K.</div></div></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary class="faq-q">Can I self-host Kuest?</summary><div class="faq-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="faq-panel"><div class="faq-panel-inner"><div class="faq-a">The codebase is open source under the <a href="https://github.com/kuestcom/prediction-market/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kuest MIT+Commons license</a>. Forks for branding, frontend changes, and custom UX are welcome. Production deployments, however, must use Kuest infrastructure. Running an independent trading stack requires a separate <a href="mailto:hello@kuest.com">commercial agreement</a>.</div></div></div></details></div></div></div></div></section><section class="panel-wrap panel-static panel-compact" id="p9"><div class="panel-sticky"><div class="cta-content r v py-12"><h2 class="cta-h">Your market, your audience, your rules.</h2><p class="cta-sub">Start free. No credit card required.</p><div class="cta-btns"><a href="/launch" class="btn-cta btn-cta-primary"><span class="cta-label">Create my prediction market</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section></main><footer><div class="foot-brand"><div class="nav-logo gap-2 font-sans text-[15px] font-bold text-muted"><span class="kuest-logo-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Kuest</div><div class="foot-note">Built on Polymarket-derived contracts, audited by OpenZeppelin</div></div><div class="foot-links"><a id="footerDocsLink" class="foot-link-icon" href="https://docs.kuest.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Docs" title="Docs"><img src="/assets/images/docs.svg" width="21" height="21" loading="lazy" alt=""/></a><a id="footerMailLink" class="foot-link-icon" href="mailto:hello@kuest.com" aria-label="Contact" title="Contact"><img src="/assets/images/mail.svg" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" alt=""/></a><a id="footerXLink" class="foot-link-icon" href="https://x.com/kuest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="X" title="X"><img src="/assets/images/x.svg" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" alt=""/></a><a id="footerDiscordLink" class="foot-link-icon" href="https://discord.gg/kuest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Discord" title="Discord"><img src="/assets/images/discord.svg" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" alt=""/></a></div></footer><div class="source-modal" id="sourceModal" hidden="" aria-hidden="true"><button type="button" class="source-modal-backdrop" data-source-close="true" aria-label="Back to page"></button><div class="source-modal-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="sourceModalTitle"><button type="button" class="source-modal-close" aria-label="Back to page" data-source-close="true">×</button><div class="source-modal-kicker" id="sourceModalOutlet">Source</div><h3 class="source-modal-title" id="sourceModalTitle">Source title</h3><div class="source-modal-url" id="sourceModalUrl">source-url.com</div><div class="source-modal-frame-wrap " id="sourceModalFrameWrap"><div class="source-modal-frame-loading" id="sourceModalLoading">Loading source...</div><iframe id="sourceModalFrame" class="source-modal-frame" title="Source preview" src="about:blank" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-forms allow-popups" referrerPolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe></div><p class="source-modal-note" id="sourceModalNote">If this publisher blocks embeds, use the external link below.</p><div class="source-modal-actions"><a href="#" id="sourceModalExternal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-cta btn-cta-secondary">Open source in new tab</a><button type="button" class="btn-cta btn-cta-secondary" data-source-close="true">Back to page</button></div></div></div><!--astro:end--></astro-island></body></html>